  "notes": "U.S. bond-market full-day trading closures; early closes remain business days. Good Friday 2026 (April 3) is a noon early-close session, not a full closure. Published annual fixture: 2026. Other year-specific exceptions require published-schedule maintenance. This is not the SOFR publication calendar or the exact MBS settlement-date table. <https://www.sifma.org/resources/guides-playbook/holiday-schedule>"
